  "body": "Offering a well-designed layout with modern living and plenty of space for the whole family, this four-bedroom home is an ideal choice for those seeking comfort, convenience and easy-care living. \r\n \r\nThe ground floor features a modern open-plan kitchen with a wall oven, cooktop and plenty of bench and storage space. The kitchen flows naturally through to the combined dining and lounge area, creating a practical and comfortable space for everyday family living. There is also a handy guest toilet for added convenience. \r\n \r\nThe living area flows seamlessly into the outdoor entertaining space, where you will find a private deck and fully fenced backyard, ideal for summer BBQs, entertaining friends and family, or simply relaxing outdoors. \r\n \r\nUpstairs are four well-proportioned bedrooms, serviced by two well-appointed bathrooms. The main bedroom enjoys the added privacy of its own ensuite, while the family bathroom services the remaining bedrooms, providing a practical setup for busy family life. \r\n \r\nThe property is well positioned close to transport links, shops, local amenities and schools, making it a convenient choice for families and professionals alike. Zoned for Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n \r\nFor more information or to arrange a private viewing, please contact us today or come along to one of our scheduled open homes.",
